&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4daa64b4c380&quot;&gt;Nebius Token Factory is building production-grade inference for open-source, customer, and internally optimized models. This role owns the path from model artifact to fast, reliable, cost-efficient endpoint. The work sits at the intersection of model internals, inference engines, serving architecture, benchmarking, and production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
