including renewables, storage, clean &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;molecules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt; and low carbon infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
