&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d289fcd7c1a&quot;&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;FAQs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ddd7edd2cd3e&quot;&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4743&quot; data-local-id=&quot;895e3754d5bc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a technology graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6618a4c09482&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Ready to shape the future of talent acquisition in a global trading firm? As a Senior Campus Recruiter, you&#39;ll be the driving force behind spotting and bringing the top 1% of talent from Europe&#39;s premier universities on board. Your journey involves navigating the full campus recruitment lifecycle, from identification to selection, and making your mark at European recruitment events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join our Campus Recruitment team in Europe, based in Amsterdam, part of a wider recruitment organisation of experienced tech, trading and business support recruiters. Collaboration comes first here: we share knowledge, step in for each other in peak season, and succeed as one team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end recruitment process: screening, interviewing, assessment review, offer conversations and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with business leaders and interviewers, and make sure we&#39;re aligned on hiring needs and on what great looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a data-driven way, using insights to make our process sharper, fairer and more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to strategic projects such as market analyses, process and assessment reviews, and improvements to how we select&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IMC at recruitment events across Europe, with frequent travel (more than four times a year)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of industry experience, ideally within a global finance, trading, tech or consultancy organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of financial markets and the trading industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical eye: you question how things are done, spot trends early and turn them into practical improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to think strategically and act tactically, moving easily between the bigger picture and getting things done today&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solution-oriented mindset: when something isn&#39;t working, you look for a better way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy operational recruitment. Running a tight process and giving candidates a great experience energises you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build relationships with the business with ease and earn trust as a partner, not just a service provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a dynamic environment where no two days are the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well in a larger team and put collaboration first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You keep up with industry trends and best practices in campus recruitment and bring them into your own work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A unique work culture that values collaboration, initiative, and ownership. Our professional and friendly environment provides the perfect backdrop for your growth and responsibilities. We operate with transparency in a flat structure, allowing you direct engagement with stakeholders and professionals. Your input matters here, contributing to our collective success. At IMC, continuous learning is a priority. Various training and on-the-job growth opportunities allow you to shape your path within the organisation. This isn&#39;t just a job; it&#39;s a journey of ongoing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We appreciate your efforts. Our highly competitive salary comes with great perks. If you&#39;re looking for a friendly yet professional space to contribute and grow, IMC is the place. If you&#39;re ready for a role beyond routine recruitment, where your experience can contribute to the future of our team and company, apply now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Are you comfortable navigating complex software systems, working with coding agents, and defining what makes developer tools actually useful? Do you want to shape how developers and AI work together inside IDEs?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agentic development is changing how software gets built. Developers no longer just chat with AI – they delegate tasks, run parallel agent sessions, and steer autonomous changes. As agents take on more work, reviewing and owning the output is becoming the hardest part of the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JetBrains Air is our open system for agentic development. It brings tools like Codex, GitHub Copilot, Claude Agent, Gemini, and Junie directly into JetBrains IDEs, providing an agentic-first user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to lead key areas of Air. You’ll take ownership of high-impact workflows, work closely with cross-functional teams (including software engineers, designers, ML researchers, analysts, DevRel, and product marketing), and turn technical complexity into clear product direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of key parts of Air in JetBrains IDEs, driving work from problem framing and discovery to delivery, adoption, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and refine core agentic workflows, including task delegation, session monitoring, steering, and code review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model complex user flows, system states, permissions, and integration schemes to guide engineering and design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a transparent roadmap that balances quick improvements with long-term strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define telemetry, design experiments, analyze product data, and make evidence-based roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study how developers interact with leading AI agents and tools to inform product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the Agent Client Protocol (ACP) ecosystem and collaborate with partners building on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with enterprise sales and support teams to address governance, privacy, and control requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems-thinking mindset that easily breaks down complex architectures, workflows, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven approach to product decisions, including hands-on experience querying and analyzing telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active personal experience using coding agents and clear perspectives on where current AI tools succeed and fail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product intuition for complex technical user experiences and developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise, and collaborative communication skills with the ability to explain complex technical concepts simply and build alignment across diverse groups of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating fast-changing technical landscapes with high ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience shipping end-user products as a product manager or in a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical grounding in software development workflows, including IDEs, git, code review, CI/CD, and package management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on technical background sufficient to collaborate closely with software and ML engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of core AI and agent concepts, including tool use, protocols (MCP/ACP), context retrieval, evaluations, and latency/cost trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write SQL or Python to analyze product metrics and experiment results independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first 6 to 12 months, success in this role means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving measurable growth in active Air users and improving weekly/monthly retention (D7/D30).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increasing agent session completion rates and the proportion of agent-generated changes accepted by developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing clear, telemetry-backed decisions across your product roadmap areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering validated product hypotheses consistently each quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing directly to JetBrains AI revenue growth and overall IDE value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary – We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule – Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off – More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities – Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free meals and snacks – Lunch and refreshments provided to keep you fueled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness – On-site gyms or sports club stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events – Company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a challenge you&#39;d enjoy, send us your resume and a short note on why you&#39;re interested in Air.&lt;/p&gt;
